---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="rule-top bg-paper">
  <div class="container-edit py-12">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
      <div class="md:col-span-7">
        <img
          src="/logo-horizontal.svg"
          alt="TerraDart"
          width="160"
          height="32"
          class="h-7 w-auto"
        />
        <p class="text-mute mt-3 text-sm max-w-md">
          Type-safe Google Cloud IaC for Dart. Synthesizes standard
          <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">*.tf.json</code> — your existing
          <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">terraform apply</code> pipeline
          runs unchanged.
        </p>
        <p class="text-mute mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
          Dart™ and the related logo are trademarks of Google LLC. We are not
          endorsed by or affiliated with Google LLC. &quot;Terraform&quot; is a
          registered trademark of HashiCorp, Inc. TerraDart is an independent
          open-source project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
          sponsored by HashiCorp or Google.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <div class="sct-numeral mb-3">// resources</div>
        <nav class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm font-mono">
          <a href="/docs/" class="link-mark">docs →</a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/nozomi-koborinai/terradart"
            class="link-mark">GitHub →</a
          >
          <a href="https://pub.dev/packages/terradart_core" class="link-mark"
            >pub.dev →</a
          >
          <a href="/llms.txt" class="link-mark">llms.txt →</a>
          <a href="/privacy" class="link-mark">privacy →</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
    <hr class="mt-12" />
    <div
      class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mt-6 text-xs text-mute"
    >
      <span>
        © {year} TerraDart ·
        <a href="/privacy" class="link-mark">analytics via Cloudflare</a>
      </span>
      <span>
        Made by
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nozomi-koborinai/"
          class="link-mark text-[var(--color-ink)]">Nozomi Koborinai</a
        >
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
